---
number: 174
title: I Need Thee Every Hour
author: Annie S. Hawks
composer: Robert Lowry
sp_category: "15"
topic: The Christian Refuge
notes: "AUTO: chorus detected heuristically — verify"
---

[verse 1]
I need Thee every hour;
Most gracious Lord;
No tender voice like Thine
Can peace afford.

[chorus]
I need Thee, O I need Thee!
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour!
I come to Thee.

[verse 2]
I need Thee every hour;
Stay Thou near by;
Temptations lose their power
When Thou art nigh.

[chorus]
I need Thee, O I need Thee!
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour!
I come to Thee.

[verse 3]
I need Thee every hour;
In joy or pain;
Come quickly and abide,
Or life is vain.

[chorus]
I need Thee, O I need Thee!
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour!
I come to Thee.

[verse 4]
I need Thee every hour;
Teach me Thy will,
And Thy rich promises
In me fulfill.

[chorus]
I need Thee, O I need Thee!
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour!
I come to Thee.
